WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.640 --> 00:00:01.700
Last question today.

00:00:01.700 --> 00:00:02.700
Hey David.

00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:07.779
How will Joe Biden handle Ukraine attacks
from Donald Trump if he becomes the nominee?

00:00:07.779 --> 00:00:11.840
This, this is a good question because this
has already come up and Joe Biden is completely

00:00:11.840 --> 00:00:13.870
mangled the answer.

00:00:13.870 --> 00:00:18.339
I believe that Joe Biden needs to fight back
when that issue comes up.

00:00:18.339 --> 00:00:25.079
If Joe Biden is the nominee and issues of
Hunter Biden's job at the Ukrainian gas company

00:00:25.079 --> 00:00:28.849
are woven into the discussion about Trump
and impeachment.

00:00:28.849 --> 00:00:33.940
Other day I saw an interview that Joe Biden
gave where he was asked about it and he just,

00:00:33.940 --> 00:00:35.210
he seemed totally disoriented.

00:00:35.210 --> 00:00:37.560
He seemed dazed almost.

00:00:37.560 --> 00:00:41.980
How has he not come up with a strong answer
on this issue?

00:00:41.980 --> 00:00:43.680
He's already looking weak about it.

00:00:43.680 --> 00:00:45.090
So a few thoughts that I have.

00:00:45.090 --> 00:00:47.940
Number one, Biden needs a strategy.

00:00:47.940 --> 00:00:52.610
I would sort of workshop it and there's a
few different angles you could take.

00:00:52.610 --> 00:00:55.899
One angle you could take and say, Oh, hold
on a second, hold on a second.

00:00:55.899 --> 00:01:03.219
Uh, the Trump administration has Trump's unelected
children doing high level work.

00:01:03.219 --> 00:01:06.130
You've got Rudy Giuliani son working in the
white house.

00:01:06.130 --> 00:01:09.950
You have William Barr's son working in the
white house or somewhere associated with the

00:01:09.950 --> 00:01:11.350
administration.

00:01:11.350 --> 00:01:15.299
You've got the president's kids regularly
meeting with foreign leaders.

00:01:15.299 --> 00:01:21.570
Maybe the fact that Hunter Biden got a job
at a gas company is not actually the biggest

00:01:21.570 --> 00:01:22.780
concern right now.

00:01:22.780 --> 00:01:26.820
When you've got Ivanka sitting in for the
secretary of state or whatever it was that

00:01:26.820 --> 00:01:31.369
she was doing a couple of years ago at the
G 20, that's one angle.

00:01:31.369 --> 00:01:35.870
Um, the counter to that is you're, you're
sort of muddying it up because you're not

00:01:35.870 --> 00:01:37.409
really defending anything.

00:01:37.409 --> 00:01:40.299
You're just saying Trump is doing it worse.

00:01:40.299 --> 00:01:45.560
So another angle that you could take is something
like, listen, I've helped my children to be

00:01:45.560 --> 00:01:47.159
successful.

00:01:47.159 --> 00:01:48.720
You've helped yours.

00:01:48.720 --> 00:01:54.650
Neither has anything to do with you being
impeached for your bribery and extortion of

00:01:54.650 --> 00:01:55.650
Ukraine.

00:01:55.650 --> 00:01:57.020
You are an impeached president.

00:01:57.020 --> 00:02:00.320
You're desperate to distract, et cetera, et
cetera.

00:02:00.320 --> 00:02:02.920
That might be sort of like a stronger way
to go about it.

00:02:02.920 --> 00:02:07.030
I'm not a political messaging expert, but
what I can tell you is what Jay, that when

00:02:07.030 --> 00:02:12.060
Joe Biden was asked about this the other day,
how do you not have a planned answer for it?

00:02:12.060 --> 00:02:16.170
You are going to get a hundred versions of
basically the same question.

00:02:16.170 --> 00:02:22.080
Isn't there something to why Hunter Biden
had this cushy job on the, on the board of

00:02:22.080 --> 00:02:23.739
this Ukrainian gas company?

00:02:23.739 --> 00:02:28.750
Isn't it true that for whatever Trump did
wrong, there may, maybe there should be an

00:02:28.750 --> 00:02:32.110
investigation into what went on with you and
Hunter, but he's going to be asked this a

00:02:32.110 --> 00:02:33.200
hundred different ways.

00:02:33.200 --> 00:02:34.349
He's got to be strong on it.

00:02:34.349 --> 00:02:39.340
He's completely bungled it so far in a cringe-worthy,
embarrassing way.

00:02:39.340 --> 00:02:43.890
Um, and he, if he is going to be the nominee
and he's not the nominee yet, and maybe he

00:02:43.890 --> 00:02:50.950
won't be, but if he is, if he can't be prepared
for that in a strong way, which it'll require

00:02:50.950 --> 00:02:54.510
a level of strength we've not really seen
from Joe Biden this campaign, other than in

00:02:54.510 --> 00:02:57.819
very isolated instances, he's going to get
crushed by Trump.

00:02:57.819 --> 00:03:04.099
You will have an impeached president making
Joe Biden look bad on issues surrounding what

00:03:04.099 --> 00:03:08.110
led to the impeachment unless Joe Biden can
be properly prepared.

00:03:08.110 --> 00:03:09.230
I want to hear from you.

00:03:09.230 --> 00:03:10.230
How do you believe that

00:03:10.230 --> 00:03:12.659
Joe Biden could answer those questions?

00:03:12.659 --> 00:03:15.739
Leave a reply as a comment if you're watching
on YouTube.

00:03:15.739 --> 00:03:17.999
Otherwise, send me a tweet@deepakthedavidpakmanshowatdavidpakman.com.

